# Capacitor Mobile Development

> Full documentation: `.cursor/skills/capacitor/SKILL.md`  
> Next static export constraints: `.cursor/skills/capacitor-next-export/SKILL.md`

## Project Identity

- App ID: `com.travelbug.client`
- webDir: `out`
- iOS scheme: `travelbug://`
- Capacitor 8

## Build Commands

```bash
cd apps/client-app

# Full pipeline (env + next export + cap sync)
pnpm build-mobile
pnpm build-mobile -- staging

# Quick sync after web build
pnpm build && pnpm cap:sync
pnpm cap:ios
pnpm cap:android
```

## Versioning

- Source of truth: `package.json` → `marketingVersion` / `buildNumber`
- `pnpm bump-version` / `pnpm sync-version` — see `docs/VERSIONING.md`

## Platform Patterns

- `Capacitor.isNativePlatform()` for native-only code
- Safe area: `env(safe-area-inset-*)`
- Keyboard: listeners + `Keyboard` plugin config
- Match `backgroundColor` in capacitor.config to CSS `--background`

## Android

- AGP 8.x+: `proguard-android-optimize.txt`
- Permissions in `AndroidManifest.xml` when adding plugins
